{"login": "khovratovich", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "a53a1bc8e11c51f9d8a83e56fb88bdd9aba83559", "message": "makefile fix", "created_at": "2015-02-01T00:07:36Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c801ea852a97334eb244f764b100ac3e4994135e", "message": "Merge pull request #2 from khovratovich/version-1.1-(tweaks)\n\nVersion 1.1 (tweaks)", "created_at": "2015-01-31T08:18:27Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "83365705272a33f948aae3307a2cab21e75f2346", "message": "Permutation bug", "created_at": "2015-01-30T21:18:49Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "50b93872ca8a5bc6b8e7432b5086d195edee5dd8", "message": "Permutation bug", "created_at": "2015-01-30T21:17:05Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0252ee2d1b69eccd7dbbabe843290a2de1bab8b1", "message": "Linux-compatible version of Argon v1.1", "created_at": "2015-01-30T14:03:25Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d6c2f2d33e503737d272917136ba41d0bbc540c1", "message": "Bug fixes", "created_at": "2015-01-29T20:29:02Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4f7b7e00d150d66d9673c729e42fe71cff5cc43a", "message": "Long output bug corrected", "created_at": "2015-01-28T11:19:20Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4f584f1c7a41e003fa602aaa8854b61f819a25e9", "message": "Argon version 1.1 (tweaks)\n\nNumber of slices in ShuffleSlices is a tunable parameter to fix the\ndegree of parallelism available to the adversary.\nNumber of slices  and the tag length are now part of the input to\nfurther prevent the adversary from amortizing exhaustive search.\nAssociated data $X$ can now be processed as part of the input. It can be\nan arbitrary string, containing application context, user data, or any\nother parameters that shall be binded to the hash value.\nAll the inputs are hashed with a cryptographic hash function (Blake2b)\nin order to extract the entropy from the password and the salt as soon\nas possible and put it into a short string $I$.\nDue to the use of a hash function, password and salt may have arbitrary\n(up to $2^{32}$ bytes) length.\nThe string $I$ is partitioned in only 4 parts, which fill the first 8\nbytes of each 16-byte memory block, whereas the rest is taken by the\ncounter. This has been done for simplicity.\nThe Shuffle algorithm now employs a new formula to compute the value of\nthe counter $j$, which should not allow to parallelize the algorithm, as\nit is the case for RC4.\nTo produce the tag, memory is divided in two, then both parts are XORed\ninto two 128-bit blocks. Both blocks are then input to a variable length\nhash function (Blake2b),   which produces tags of arbitrary length.", "created_at": "2015-01-28T10:38:54Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d2b4ae6393fa0850fde51beb24e9af26a3bb50d1", "message": "Pseudo-random parallelism\n\nAdded pseudo-random parallel execution of ShuffleSlices", "created_at": "2014-12-02T18:17:26Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4ea3115cd85b80f66bb2e6d94d555eeda022528b", "message": "Bugfix\n\nFixed the bug with incorrect counter value in the first call to\nSubGroups", "created_at": "2014-12-02T15:11:09Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "757e099afa11b20bfa052b72a741c71efd0a9d4e", "message": "Improved implementation\n\n- password value no longer appears in cleartext in the memory;\n- threads are always enabled;\n- redundant code deleted.", "created_at": "2014-12-02T12:32:41Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2346df1af8b684a3470d3fcbba44592a1f4593f8", "message": "Bug fix", "created_at": "2014-04-11T21:15:27Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "259aae79c8f30cb3e79c1fda24e998490832534f", "message": "Binaries\n\nAdded Win x64 Binaries", "created_at": "2014-04-11T13:35:20Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b496dfdc7aae9f9caef8719fd065454ca89c60d4", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2014-04-11T12:18:24Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "94d1935dc49cf773b00b5bb9a0907bbc7f33c111", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2014-04-11T12:17:57Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1a9813be6bcadfb947ffe4b8180b4a117bd7e9cf", "message": "Benchmark\n\nAdded benchmark option", "created_at": "2014-04-11T10:43:10Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d02ca6f8aaeb294dbc4562fcfbd5a266ec4eaa6f", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2014-04-11T10:10:42Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2259fa92e238c15f0111fb918a1ed538c49fc0e1", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2014-04-11T10:10:04Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f264bc6922226432ed780ade7e18bf2cb3f5748", "message": "Windows code cleaning\n\nWindows and Linux codes are the same", "created_at": "2014-04-11T10:08:14Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9ffd7fcae7625f3c0cced5d3140798afe46de569", "message": "Linux Optimized version", "created_at": "2014-04-11T10:01:39Z", "repo": "Argon", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7